{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/470879-angelic-truisms","id":470879,"title":"angelic truisms","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-06T21:45:38-07:00","id":470879,"title":"angelic truisms","content":"All angels can fall.<br /> <br /> All angels are created by the god machine.<br /> <br /> Either as written or in your own head cannon can anyone think of anything that is universally true of the GM's angels?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/252-basketcase","name":"basketcase","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar252_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-06T21:50:59-07:00","id":470904,"title":"","content":"There is some suggestion that all angels can't fall. Exiles seem to have been unable to despite being outside the God-machine's influence. It may be only certain ones, say ones with a Cipher, can. Also, one possibility is Analysts were unable to fall until recently, but it is possible option not default fact.<br /> <br /> Given the similarity between Angels and Quashmal, it is not impossible that the first angels were coopted from something else.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-06T22:22:45-07:00","id":470921,"title":"","content":"<b>Angels are finite.</b> Whether it be general vulnerability, ephemeral bans or banes, integrations into essential systems, there is something that could be used to bring about an angel's ruin.<br /> <br /> <b>Angels are not self-sufficient.</b> They don't exist for their own sake, but receive support and offer support in turn. An angel is always a node in some manner of network.<br /> <br /> I don't necessarily believe all angels are created by the God Machine. There are beings that can rightly be called &quot;angels&quot; besides those with whom Demon concerns itself, like <i>qashmallim</i> or the dominions of the Supernal Aether, and the above statements aren't meant to extend to those angels, only the angels of Demon. Even restricting to the angels of the God Machine, though, it's not like the Machine to create <i>ex nihilo. </i>Is an angel &quot;summoned&quot; by an occult matrix assembled from the essence and resonance of the acts that constitute that matrix, or are there other components from which the God Machine's angels may have been fashioned as well, in addition to the energies necessary to bring them to a point in space and time?<br /> <br /> What's the difference between creating a thing and merely fashioning or processing it? Can a blacksmith, given metals mined from the earth, create a sword? Can an oil refinery, supplied with crude petroleum, create gasoline?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-06T22:57:10-07:00","id":470934,"title":"","content":"Angels are not something to take lightly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-07T18:51:29-07:00","id":471955,"title":"","content":"<b>The Mission Matters</b> - No Angel is divorced from it's purpose. They don't ask 'why am I here?', they <i>know</i>. And they care about it. It is never a neutral subject matter to them. Love or hate it, reject it or accept it, the mission has a hold on the Angel's emotion. Even the most robotic servant of the God Machine has strong feelings about their mission.<br /> <br /> <b>They Carry God's Gravity</b> - Angels aren't minor pieces on the board, more<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chess\" target=\"_blank\"> Bishops then Pawns</a>. There is an importance to their existence. The Machine has less costly tools available to it, so when it uses an Angel, it is significant. It is something <i>More</i> to have an Angel perform a mission as opposed to say; a cult or a stigmatic. It has effects upon reality in ways that aren't necessarily readily apparent but can be felt.<br /> [Not quite full-blown Unease Sybaris, (Archangel's are an exception because the players need some kind of warning), but I do feel that it adds flavour.]<ul><li><b>They are Heavy</b> - As in, too many and the system/Infrastructure will crack under the strain. Only so many Angels can benefit from the Machine in an area. This can &amp; does change depending on the environment. Every new Piece, Subverted or not, will alter this balance. Bigger Infrastructure generally can support more, but smaller more powerful Pieces can outstrip them. Learning the balance is useful.</li> </ul><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":1624,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","user":"FallenEco","date":". 04-07-2015, 09:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}